# Methods {#sec-methods}

The approach in one display equation:

$$ D_{\mathrm{KL}}(P\,\|\,Q) = \sum_k p_k \log\frac{p_k}{q_k} $$

The divergence is non-negative, with equality exactly when $P = Q$, so the objective is
bounded below.

## Setup {#sec-setup}

